Package:     actilifecounts, Generate Activity Counts from Raw Accelerometer Data
Version:     1.1.1 as installed
Repository:  https://github.com/jhmigueles/actilifecounts
Licence:     LGPL (>= 3), as declared in the package DESCRIPTION

Author and maintainer: Jairo Hidalgo Migueles.

canhrActi uses actilifecounts by calling its exported functions through the
