-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
5. agcounts (steps restated, modified)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Package:     agcounts, Calculate 'ActiGraph' Counts from Accelerometer Data
Version:     0.7.0
Repository:  https://github.com/bhelsel/agcounts
Licence:     MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 University of Kansas
             A copy of the licence is included with this package as
             inst/LICENSE.agcounts.

Authors and contributors: Brian C. Helsel (aut, cre), Paul R. Hibbing (ctb),
Robert N. Montgomery (ctb), Eric D. Vidoni (ctb), Jonathan Clutton (ctb),
John Muschelli (ctb); University of Kansas (cph).

R/gt3x_counts.R restates the agcounts steps .resample, .bpf_filter,
.resample_10hz and .sum_counts so they can run block by block and carry their
state from one block to the next. The header of that file names what was
taken.
